{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c","name":"Move","source":{"id":"source:reference-6ecc3df6bffdd06c","title":"Move","revision":18374,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:02:09Z","sha256":"ccaa2ef9cf30f0a2ede0eccb4cd1147f933e1d282c52ed73308949df7c9b78c5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18374","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Move&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6ecc3df6bffdd06c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can Move up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Even Moving 1 square is considered a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Nonstandard modes of movement are also covered by this type of Action, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},". The only restriction for movement in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Combat"}," is that you cannot reenter a square you just left.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Commander","referenceId":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83"}," can Move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," up to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Unlike Character Combat, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"}," allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to move into a square with another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". A square can hold up to two ground ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," and two flying ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," at a time. There are no direct consequences for moving past, into, or out of a square already occupied by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," (though occupying the same square might allow the enemy to target you with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attacks"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Diagonal Movement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Moving diagonally costs double. When Moving or counting along a diagonal path, each diagonal step counts as 2 squares. If a character moves diagonally through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low Objects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low_Objects"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"},", the cost of movement doubles twice (that is, each square counts as 4 squares). A character can't make Diagonal Movement past the corner or end of a wall that extends to a grid center.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Occupied Squares"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Sometimes you can pass through an occupied square. You can Move through a space occupied by any character, creature, or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," that doesn't consider you an opponent; you can also move through a square occupied by an enemy that doesn't present an obstacle, such as one who is dead, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unconscious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unconscious"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},". A character can Move through a space occupied by an enemy three or more size categories larger or smaller than the Moving character.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Finally, a character ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," can attempt to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tumble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tumble"}," through an enemy's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
